    "value": "Chegar a <c val=\"bfd4fd\" hlt-name=\"#TooltipNumbers\">3</c> aplicações de <c val=\"FF8B8B\" hlt-name=\"#WhitemaneDesperation\">Desespero</c> concede <c val=\"bfd4fd\" hlt-name=\"#TooltipNumbers\">190</c><c val=\"a7a7a7\" hlt-name=\"#ColorGray\">~~0.04~~</c> de cura e reaplica <c val=\"FFF5C2\" hlt-name=\"#WhitemaneZeal\">Zelo</c> aos aliados com <c val=\"FFF5C2\" hlt-name=\"#WhitemaneZeal\">Zelo</c>."
